HB0105 Breach orders due process.
Sponsored By: Select Water Committee
AN ACT relating to water; requiring the state engineer to hold a public meeting,
seek alternatives and provide notice before executing an emergency order to
breach a dam or diversion; providing an exception; requiring rulemaking;
specifying applicability; and providing for an effective date.
